# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo, regardless of the checkout
# platform's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF
# source files, which fails the Docker image build: Spotless (running inside
# the Linux gradle build container) enforces LF and rejects CRLF as a format
# violation (spotlessJavaCheck).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
